{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9d011f91eed550ecd3d8bb47fa4ec6b4c5cc79ef42632b8adcf82e40b63e3bf4","ja":"麗花とプロデューサーの隠し事","zh":"丽花和制作人的秘密","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f858ec8fe605ee2998469ec8e490d88733bd3996902abf63211759b64a10138e","ja":"でも、誰かが炎上したなんて話、\n聞いたことないよな……。","zh":"不过，从来没听说过\n有谁引起了众怒啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e7c892233626aa38791ac71ac8bd4226203fafff7b2965cb2d0407a9d102a628","ja":"まだ知られていないセンセーショナルな\nプロブレムが起きたのかもしれませんね……。","zh":"也许是发生了什么鲜为人知、\n轰动一时的问题吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ac717f1dfa3637e8e51726dc3ed0d4342c883b294cae448f5112d16589d9985c","ja":"だから●●●●プロデューサーもレイカも\nシークレットにしているのでしょうか？","zh":"所以●●●●制作人和丽花才都\n保持保密吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e29493338bf1c9443c56d1f081038945472cd771c23204bb8d11a3697b0415c0","ja":"わたしたちにも秘密にするくらい\n大きな問題って……何があったんでしょう？","zh":"到底出了什么事，\n严重到连我们也要瞒着呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0d74eb42d7676fe9772967f6563cdc8e126e527a98e01055bfb176cca36e1626","ja":"麗花さんだけが知っちゃった何かが\nあるのかなぁ？","zh":"难道有什么是只有丽花才知道的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"25e7626ca90a8216e5022e5615427b519524e04151877f8fd422f79d7e95ceef","ja":"例えば……撮影の裏で\nすっごい事故が起きてた……とか？","zh":"比如……拍摄幕后\n发生了非常严重的事故……之类的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"134e48ff7f52a652c488f829628bc7eb335f6c5e4f848a5cc57b25682bd162b9","ja":"それなら公開中止になるのは\n考えられますね……ロコ的には納得できませんけど。","zh":"那样的话，中止上映倒也是\n有可能的呢……虽然从ROCO的角度来看无法接受就是了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2507cf62c6a295fdc728dad59ab75ab25991ffb74525a2517e1cb4fc4392febd","ja":"今からでも何かできることがあるかもしれないよな……\nアタシ、詳しい話を聞いてくるよ！","zh":"说不定现在也还有什么能做的事呢……\n我去打听一下详细情况！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"14014e2a3f3597fcaf0301f2548add49a8d9dbc128a49a7e3fefa8434f455195","ja":"え～～～っ！？\n映画が中止になるの？　どうして？","zh":"诶～～～！？\n电影要中止了吗？为什么？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"50cf9f32c8557cd62c3c2fdd71c95e6a6e61ac0f9debb64821b0aa7af9e376ca","ja":"どうしてって……さっき、劇場の裏で\n●●●●プロデューサーと話してただろ？","zh":"为什么……因为你刚才在剧场后面，\n跟●●●●制作人说话了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"d6a3ecd5e80d03517159b58f9b9598e65f78b6faa5ebda7b1a8c6bf519d5c04f","ja":"盗み聞きするつもりはなかったんだけどさ……。","zh":"我也不是故意要偷听的啦……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"aba7cb6a61f7f71757711962c917bbc5c18a414cbd1b7ae784f18d7e9125e1da","ja":"あー、あのお話、聞かれちゃってたんだ？\n秘密にしておきたかったんだけどな～。あれはね……。","zh":"啊——那件事，原来被你听到了呀？\n我还想保密的呢～。那是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"d924bf7292b15b8360df1807a9e4a8b968e69e54dfcf76115c878aa4d0689323","ja":"『映画』の打ち上げのサプライズパーティーを\n計画してたの。みんなをびっくりさせたくって。","zh":"我们本来在策划电影庆功宴的惊喜派对，\n想给大家一个惊喜来着。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"2354d9086f81d65bf267352f0ebd6ab91e0bd5d695cc8ad8ba02b2d7fb84e77e","ja":"でも、スケジュールの『問題』で、残念だけど\n『中止』になっちゃうかもって。","zh":"不过，说是由于日程上的“问题”，虽然很遗憾，\n但搞不好会“取消”。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"bc57ef43b53f7ffa937eba6a1cd8c0f298e51a240095dfec480326874df15771","ja":"……えええっ、サプライズパーティー！？\nじゃあアタシの勘違いだったってこと！？","zh":"……诶诶诶，惊喜派对！？\n这么说是我搞错了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"84abe635f6236b0a126fc1bca8398f1c3184c2142dc310c7c5690d8f34fe1cb8","ja":"マイガー！\nみんなになんて説明すればいいんだろう……。","zh":"我的天啊！\n该怎么向大家解释才好呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1319.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"6f3984a813a842b7e7da6d841c3d71b37137b3b29bee4e763dd72a70a5ec7fd5","ja":"はぁ……やっぱアタシのカン、\n全然鋭くなんて、なってなかったみたいだな……。","zh":"唉……看来我的直觉，\n根本就完全没有变准嘛……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
